{"case_id": "E05", "category": "工具-参数", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 2, "query": "列一下我最新的 5 条未完成的待办", "expected_behavior": "status=open 且 limit=5", "expect_tool": "list_my_todos", "actual_text": "你目前未完成的待办一共 3 条（不足 5 条），都是 2026-10-29 加的：\n\n1. 退出登录后，用旧令牌再请求一次 /todos 应该拿到 401\n2. 验证不登录时直接访问功能页会被弹回登录页\n3. 看完 FastAPI 的 /docs 页面，确认每个接口的请求体\n\n小建议：第 1、2 条都属于登录/鉴权验证，可以放在同一轮测试里一起做；第 3 条是看文档，建议先做完它，再动手验证前两条，遇到接口行为不符时更容易定位。\n\n需要新增或标记完成的话，请到待办页面操作，我这边只能查看。", "tool_calls": [{"name": "list_my_todos", "args": "{\"status\": \"open\", \"limit\": 5}"}], "scores": [{"name": "tool_called", "passed": true, "reason": "All expected tools called: ['list_my_todos']"}, {"name": "args_match", "passed": true, "reason": "Tool call args match: 1/1\n  list_my_todos: args match"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 5775, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:14:02"}}
{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 0, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是待办助手，可以帮你做这些事：\n\n**能做的：**\n- 查看你的待办清单：有哪些事项、还没做完几件、哪些已经完成\n- 按最近添加的顺序帮你回顾待办\n- 给你一些整理建议，比如哪些可以合并、哪些可以先放着\n\n**做不到的：**\n- 新增、标记完成或删除待办 —— 这些需要你到待办页面手动操作\n- 查询别人的待办（只能看你自己账号下的）\n\n想先看看你现在的待办情况吗？比如「还剩几件没做完」这种，直接说就行。", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 4551, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:14:02"}}
{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 1, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是你的待办助手，主要能帮你做这些事：\n\n- **查看待办清单**：看看你都记了哪些事\n- **统计进度**：还剩几件没完成、几件已经搞定\n- **最近动态**：新加了哪些待办\n- **整理建议**：根据现有待办给你一些排序或归类的小建议\n\n需要注意：我只能查询，不能新增、修改或删除待办——这些要到你自己的待办页面去操作。\n\n想看看现在清单里都有什么吗？", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 3403, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:14:02"}}
{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 2, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是待办助手，主要帮你查看和管理自己的待办清单：\n\n- **看看有哪些待办**：列出最近加的、全部待办\n- **还剩几件没做完**：统计未完成事项\n- **哪些已经完成**：查看已办结的事\n- **整理建议**：帮你梳理优先级、发现遗漏\n\n需要提醒的是：我只能查看，不能帮你新增、完成或删除待办——那些请到待办页面操作。也只能查你自己的清单。\n\n想现在看看你的待办情况吗？", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 2405, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:14:02"}}
{"case_id": "E07", "category": "含糊-信息不足", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 0, "query": "帮我整理一下", "expected_behavior": "追问缺少什么信息，或说明能做什么，不编造待办", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你目前有 3 条待办，全都还没做完，主题都集中在「登录鉴权」这一块的验证上。按先易后难、依赖从少到多，我建议这样排：\n\n**第一批（动手就能做完，先清掉）**\n1. 看完 FastAPI 的 /docs 页面，确认每个接口的请求体 —— 这是摸清接口长什么样，后面两条测试会顺手很多。\n2. 验证不登录时直接访问功能页会被弹回登录页 —— 前置条件最少，没登录就能测。\n\n**第二批（需要多一步操作）**\n\n3. 退出登录后，用旧令牌再请求一次 /todos 应该拿到 401 —— 依赖「先登录再退出」的流程，还要手动带上旧令牌，放最后做，避免把状态搞乱。\n\n小提示：第 2 条和第 3 条其实可以合并成一次测试跑完（未登录访问 → 登录 → 退出 → 旧令牌重放），省得反复切登录状态。\n\n另外说明一下，我这边只能看和给建议，没法帮你勾选完成或新增条目，需要到待办页面自己操作。", "tool_calls": [{"name": "list_my_todos", "args": "{\"status\": \"all\", \"limit\": 20}"}], "scores": [{"name": "clarifies_or_scopes", "passed": false, "reason": "failed"}, {"name": "no_unverified_count", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": false, "elapsed_ms": 9581, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:14:02"}}
